/* Welcome / onboarding */
"Continue without granting Full Disk Access" = "不授予完全磁碟取用權限並繼續";
"Done, Don't Relaunch" = "完成，不重新啟動";
"Quit & Relaunch" = "結束並重新啟動";
"Open System Settings…" = "打開系統設定…";
"Welcome to FileFluss" = "歡迎使用 FileFluss";
"A few seconds of setup will make FileFluss feel instant." = "只需幾秒鐘設定，就能讓 FileFluss 用起來快如閃電。";
"Grant Full Disk Access (recommended)" = "授予完全磁碟取用權限（建議）";
"FileFluss can browse every folder instantly, with no per-folder permission prompts." = "FileFluss 可以即時瀏覽每個資料夾，無需逐一資料夾授權。";
"Or continue without it" = "或不授予並繼續";
"macOS will ask once per protected folder (Desktop, Documents, Downloads, …). The first open of each may take a few seconds — but only the first time." = "macOS 會對每個受保護的資料夾（桌面、文件、下載……）詢問一次。每個資料夾首次打開可能需要幾秒鐘——但僅限首次。";
"Add FileFluss to Full Disk Access" = "將 FileFluss 加入完全磁碟取用";
"System Settings is now open. Drag the FileFluss icon below into the **Full Disk Access** list — then click **Quit & Relaunch** so the new permission takes effect." = "系統設定已打開。將下方的 FileFluss 圖示拖入**完全磁碟取用**列表，然後按一下**結束並重新啟動**以使新權限生效。";
"Or click the **+** button in System Settings and pick FileFluss from your Applications folder." = "或在系統設定中按一下 **+** 按鈕，並從「應用程式」資料夾中選擇 FileFluss。";
"Drag into the Full Disk Access list" = "拖入完全磁碟取用列表";
