/* Help (FileFluss Help window) */
"Overview" = "概覽";
"Two‑Panel Layout" = "雙面板配置";
"Adding Cloud Accounts" = "加入雲端帳戶";
"Copying and Moving Files" = "複製和移動檔案";
"Copy Mode and Move Mode" = "複製模式和移動模式";
"Sync" = "同步";
"Compare Folders" = "比較資料夾";
"Search" = "搜尋";
"Opening Files" = "打開檔案";
"FileFluss is a dual‑panel file manager for macOS that lets you work with local folders and multiple cloud storage accounts side by side. It is built around a left and right panel — copy, move, sync, and compare files between them with a few clicks." = "FileFluss 是一款適用於 macOS 的雙面板檔案管理程式，可讓你並排處理本機資料夾和多個雲端儲存帳戶。它圍繞左右兩個面板建構——只需點按幾下，即可在兩者之間複製、移動、同步和比較檔案。";
"At a glance" = "概要";
"**Two independent panels**, each can show a local folder or a connected cloud account." = "**兩個獨立的面板**，每個都可顯示本機資料夾或已連接的雲端帳戶。";
"**Drag & drop** between panels to copy or move files." = "在面板之間**拖放**以複製或移動檔案。";
"**Sync** to make the two sides match (mirror, newer, or additive)." = "**同步**以使兩側保持一致（鏡像、較新或附加）。";
"**Compare** to see which files differ, are missing, or match between the two sides." = "**比較**以查看兩側之間哪些檔案有差異、缺少或一致。";
"**Search** across local files and every connected cloud account at once." = "同時在本機檔案和每個已連接的雲端帳戶中**搜尋**。";
"Toolbar" = "工具列";
"**Search** (⌘F) — open the search window." = "**搜尋**（⌘F）——打開搜尋視窗。";
"**Sync** — open the Sync planner." = "**同步**——打開同步規劃器。";
"**Compare** — open the Compare Folders window." = "**比較**——打開「比較資料夾」視窗。";
"**Refresh** — reload both panels." = "**重新整理**——重新載入兩個面板。";
"**Hidden Files** — toggle showing dotfiles in the active panel." = "**隱藏檔案**——在使用中面板裡切換顯示點檔案。";
"**Copy Mode** / **Move Mode** — force every drag & drop to that operation." = "**複製模式** / **移動模式**——強制每次拖放都執行該操作。";
"Right‑click the toolbar and choose *Customize Toolbar…* to rearrange or hide buttons." = "在工具列上按右鍵並選擇 *自訂工具列…* 以重新排列或隱藏按鈕。";
"FileFluss shows a left panel and a right panel. The active panel is marked with a thin accent line at the top — most actions (toolbar buttons, keyboard shortcuts, the search target) apply to whichever panel is active." = "FileFluss 顯示一個左面板和一個右面板。使用中面板頂部有一條細的強調線標記——大多數操作（工具列按鈕、鍵盤快捷鍵、搜尋目標）都會作用於目前使用中的面板。";
"Switching panels" = "切換面板";
"Click anywhere inside a panel to make it active." = "點按面板內任意位置即可將其啟用。";
"The sidebar of each panel is independent — choose a different favourite, location, or cloud account on each side." = "每個面板的側邊欄都是獨立的——可在每一側選擇不同的喜好項目、位置或雲端帳戶。";
"The path bar" = "路徑列";
"The breadcrumb at the top of each panel shows the current folder path. Click any segment to navigate up." = "每個面板頂部的路徑麵包屑顯示目前資料夾路徑。點按任一段即可向上瀏覽。";
"You can drop files onto a path‑bar segment to move/copy them into that folder." = "你也可以將檔案拖放到路徑列的某一段，以將其移動/複製到該資料夾中。";
"Cloud accounts on both sides" = "兩側的雲端帳戶";
"If you open the same cloud account in both panels (e.g. kDrive on the left and on the right), the two panels behave **independently**: you can browse to different folders on each side and drag between them." = "如果你在兩個面板中打開同一個雲端帳戶（例如左右都是 kDrive），這兩個面板將**獨立**運作：你可以在每一側瀏覽到不同的資料夾並在它們之間拖動。";
"Dragging a file from the same cloud account on the left to a folder on the right does an **in‑cloud** move/copy — the data stays on the server, no re‑upload." = "將左側同一雲端帳戶中的檔案拖到右側的某個資料夾，會執行**雲端內**移動/複製——資料保留在伺服器上，無需重新上傳。";
"Cloud accounts are connected once and then appear in the sidebar of both panels." = "雲端帳戶只需連接一次，隨後會出現在兩個面板的側邊欄中。";
"Add an account" = "加入帳戶";
"Open **Settings → Cloud Accounts** (⌘,)." = "打開 **設定 → 雲端帳戶**（⌘,）。";
"Click **Add Cloud Account** and pick the provider (kDrive, pCloud, OneDrive, Google Drive, Dropbox, MEGA, Koofr, NextCloud, WebDAV, SFTP, GMX Cloud, WordPress, …)." = "點按 **加入雲端帳戶** 並選擇服務商（kDrive、pCloud、OneDrive、Google Drive、Dropbox、MEGA、Koofr、NextCloud、WebDAV、SFTP、GMX Cloud、WordPress……）。";
"Sign in via the provider's authentication flow. FileFluss stores the tokens securely in your macOS Keychain." = "透過服務商的驗證流程登入。FileFluss 會將權杖安全地儲存在你的 macOS 鑰匙圈中。";
"The new account immediately appears in both panels' sidebars." = "新帳戶會立即出現在兩個面板的側邊欄中。";
"Use an account" = "使用帳戶";
"Click the account in either sidebar to load it in that panel." = "在任一側邊欄中點按該帳戶，即可在該面板中載入它。";
"Navigate folders the same way as local — double‑click to enter, or click breadcrumbs to go back up." = "像瀏覽本機一樣瀏覽資料夾——點兩下進入，或點按麵包屑返回上層。";
"Remove an account" = "移除帳戶";
"In **Settings → Cloud Accounts**, click the trash icon next to the account." = "在 **設定 → 雲端帳戶** 中，點按帳戶旁邊的垃圾桶圖示。";
"FileFluss disconnects the account, removes the cached login, and clears its panels." = "FileFluss 會中斷該帳戶連接、移除快取的登入資訊並清空其面板。";
"Some providers expose a sandboxed root (e.g. WordPress' media library). Behaviour like *create folder* may be unavailable for those providers — FileFluss greys out the actions that don't apply." = "某些服務商提供沙盒化的根目錄（例如 WordPress 的媒體庫）。對這些服務商，*新增資料夾* 等行為可能無法使用——FileFluss 會將不適用的操作變灰。";
"There are several ways to move or copy files between the two panels:" = "在兩個面板之間移動或複製檔案有多種方式：";
"Drag & drop" = "拖放";
"Drag selected files from one panel and drop them on the other." = "從一個面板拖動所選檔案並放到另一個面板上。";
"By default a prompt appears asking *Move or Copy?*." = "預設情況下會出現一個詢問 *移動還是複製？* 的提示。";
"Drop directly onto a folder row to land inside that folder, or onto the table background to drop into the panel's current directory." = "直接放到某個資料夾列上即可放入該資料夾，或放到表格背景上即可放入面板的目前目錄。";
"You can also drop onto a breadcrumb in the path bar to land in that ancestor folder." = "你也可以放到路徑列的某個麵包屑上，以放入該上層資料夾。";
"Right‑click" = "按右鍵";
"Select files, right‑click, and choose **Copy to Other Panel** or **Move to Other Panel**." = "選擇檔案，按右鍵，然後選擇 **複製到另一面板** 或 **移動到另一面板**。";
"Same effect as drag & drop, but no prompt — the action is taken immediately." = "效果與拖放相同，但沒有提示——操作會立即執行。";
"Conflicts" = "衝突";
"If a file with the same name already exists at the destination, FileFluss asks how to resolve the conflict (replace, keep both, skip)." = "如果目標位置已存在同名檔案，FileFluss 會詢問如何解決衝突（取代、兩者都保留、略過）。";
"If you find the *Move or Copy?* prompt repetitive, enable **Copy Mode** or **Move Mode** in the toolbar — see the next section." = "如果你覺得 *移動還是複製？* 提示太頻繁，可在工具列中啟用 **複製模式** 或 **移動模式**——見下一節。";
"**Copy Mode** and **Move Mode** are two toolbar toggles that change how every drag & drop is interpreted." = "**複製模式** 和 **移動模式** 是工具列中的兩個開關，用於改變每次拖放的解釋方式。";
"Copy Mode" = "複製模式";
"When active, every drop is automatically a **copy** — the *Move or Copy?* prompt is skipped." = "啟用後，每次放下都會自動執行**複製**——會略過 *移動還是複製？* 提示。";
"Useful when you're duplicating a lot of files between folders or panels." = "在資料夾或面板之間複製大量檔案時很有用。";
"Move Mode" = "移動模式";
"When active, every drop is automatically a **move** — files are removed from the source." = "啟用後，每次放下都會自動執行**移動**——檔案會從來源中移除。";
"Useful when re‑organising a folder." = "重新整理資料夾時很有用。";
"Important" = "重要";
"The two toggles are **mutually exclusive** — turning one on turns the other off." = "這兩個開關**互斥**——開啟其中一個會關閉另一個。";
"Both reset to off when FileFluss relaunches, so a stuck *Move Mode* can't silently destroy files across sessions." = "兩者都會在 FileFluss 重新啟動時重置為關閉，因此卡住的 *移動模式* 不會在多次工作階段中悄悄破壞檔案。";
"When neither mode is on, FileFluss falls back to the standard *Move or Copy?* prompt." = "當兩種模式都未開啟時，FileFluss 會回到標準的 *移動還是複製？* 提示。";
"**Sync** makes the destination folder match the source folder according to the rule you choose. Use it for one‑shot replications between local and cloud, or between two cloud accounts." = "**同步** 會根據你選擇的規則使目標資料夾與來源資料夾一致。可用於本機與雲端、或兩個雲端帳戶之間的一次性複製。";
"Run a sync" = "執行同步";
"Open one folder on the left and one on the right." = "在左側打開一個資料夾，在右側打開一個資料夾。";
"Click **Sync** in the toolbar." = "點按工具列中的 **同步**。";
"Choose the **direction** (Left → Right or Right → Left)." = "選擇**方向**（左 → 右 或 右 → 左）。";
"Choose the **mode** (see below)." = "選擇**模式**（見下文）。";
"FileFluss enumerates both sides and shows a plan: how many files will be added, replaced, deleted, and how many bytes will be transferred. Click **Start Sync**." = "FileFluss 會列舉兩側並顯示一個計畫：將加入、取代、刪除多少檔案，以及將傳輸多少位元組。點按 **開始同步**。";
"Modes" = "模式";
"**Newer** — copy files from the source whose modification date is newer than the destination's. Existing files only get replaced if they're truly newer." = "**較新**——從來源複製修改日期比目標更新的檔案。僅當檔案確實更新時才會取代現有檔案。";
"**Mirror** — make the destination an exact copy of the source. **Files at the destination that are not on the source are deleted.** This is destructive — FileFluss requires explicit confirmation." = "**鏡像**——使目標成為來源的精確副本。**目標中不存在於來源的檔案將被刪除。** 此操作具破壞性——FileFluss 需要明確確認。";
"**Additive** — only copy files that are missing on the destination. If a file already exists, the source is added next to it with a unique name. Nothing is overwritten or deleted." = "**附加**——僅複製目標中缺少的檔案。如果檔案已存在，會以唯一名稱將來源加到其旁邊。不會覆寫或刪除任何內容。";
"During sync, if a file with the same name exists on both sides but neither mode handles it cleanly, FileFluss asks per‑file how to resolve." = "在同步過程中，如果兩側都存在同名檔案，但沒有任何模式能乾淨地處理它，FileFluss 會逐一檔案詢問如何解決。";
"Sync runs in the background — you can keep working in either panel while it transfers. Progress shows in the destination panel's sidebar; click it to see details." = "同步在背景執行——傳輸期間你可以繼續在任一面板中工作。進度顯示在目標面板的側邊欄中；點按即可查看詳細資訊。";
"**Compare** shows you the differences between the two panels' folders without changing anything." = "**比較** 會在不更改任何內容的情況下向你顯示兩個面板資料夾之間的差異。";
"Run a comparison" = "執行比較";
"Click **Compare** in the toolbar." = "點按工具列中的 **比較**。";
"FileFluss enumerates both sides recursively and opens a window with the result." = "FileFluss 會遞迴列舉兩側，並打開一個顯示結果的視窗。";
"Reading the result" = "讀取結果";
"**Different** (red ⚠) — file exists on both sides but its size (or modification date, if enabled) differs." = "**不同**（紅色 ⚠）——檔案在兩側都存在，但其大小（或修改日期，若啟用）不同。";
"**Only on Left** (← blue) — file exists only in the left folder." = "**僅左側**（← 藍色）——檔案僅存在於左側資料夾中。";
"**Only on Right** (→ orange) — file exists only in the right folder." = "**僅右側**（→ 橙色）——檔案僅存在於右側資料夾中。";
"**Identical** (✓ green) — file matches on both sides." = "**相同**（✓ 綠色）——檔案在兩側一致。";
"Folders are **collapsible** — click the disclosure arrow to expand and see what's inside. The folder header shows aggregate counts for the active filter." = "資料夾**可摺疊**——點按展開三角形即可展開並查看其中內容。資料夾標題會顯示目前篩選條件的彙總計數。";
"Use the **filter chips** at the top to narrow to one status, e.g. show only differences." = "使用頂部的**篩選標籤**以縮小到某一狀態，例如僅顯示差異。";
"Compare Date" = "比較日期";
"Off by default — only file size is compared." = "預設關閉——僅比較檔案大小。";
"When on, files with the same size but a different modification date count as **Different**, and each row shows both modify and create timestamps along with a *Left newer* / *Right newer* badge." = "啟用後，大小相同但修改日期不同的檔案會計為**不同**，並且每一列都會顯示修改和建立時間戳記以及 *左側較新* / *右側較新* 標記。";
"Compare Again" = "再次比較";
"The comparison only re‑runs when you click **Compare** in the toolbar or **Compare Again** in the window — browsing folders while the window is open does not trigger a fresh scan." = "僅當你點按工具列中的 **比較** 或視窗中的 **再次比較** 時，比較才會重新執行——在視窗打開時瀏覽資料夾不會觸發新的掃描。";
"The compare window stays open and is **movable** — drag it aside to see both panels behind it." = "比較視窗會保持打開且**可移動**——將它拖到一旁即可看到後面的兩個面板。";
"**Search** queries the active local panel and every connected cloud account simultaneously." = "**搜尋** 會同時查詢使用中的本機面板和每個已連接的雲端帳戶。";
"Run a search" = "執行搜尋";
"Click **Search** in the toolbar, or press **⌘F**." = "點按工具列中的 **搜尋**，或按 **⌘F**。";
"Type a query — results stream in as each source responds." = "輸入查詢——結果會隨著每個來源回應而陸續顯示。";
"Filter by source using the chips below the search field." = "使用搜尋欄下方的標籤依來源進行篩選。";
"Acting on results" = "對結果進行操作";
"**Double‑click** a result to load its parent folder in the active panel." = "**點兩下** 某個結果可在使用中面板裡載入其父資料夾。";
"**Right‑click** to choose **Open in Left Panel** or **Open in Right Panel** explicitly." = "**按右鍵** 可明確選擇 **在左面板中打開** 或 **在右面板中打開**。";
"The search window stays open after picking a result, so you can pick more." = "選擇某個結果後，搜尋視窗會保持打開，以便你繼續選擇更多。";
"Closing" = "關閉";
"Click the round X close button, press **Esc**, or click the red traffic‑light button." = "點按圓形的 X 關閉按鈕、按 **Esc**，或點按紅色的紅綠燈按鈕。";
"The search window is movable and resizable — its size is remembered across launches." = "搜尋視窗可移動且可調整大小——其大小會在多次啟動之間被記住。";
"Files on local panels and on cloud accounts open the same way." = "本機面板和雲端帳戶上的檔案以相同方式打開。";
"Open in the default app" = "用預設應用程式打開";
"**Double‑click** any file. Word documents open in Word, PDFs in Preview, images in your image viewer, and so on." = "**點兩下** 任意檔案。Word 文件會在 Word 中打開，PDF 在「預覽程式」中打開，影像在你的影像檢視器中打開，依此類推。";
"Cloud files are downloaded to a temporary cache the first time, so reopening the same file is instant." = "雲端檔案會在首次打開時下載到暫存快取，因此再次打開同一檔案會很快。";
"Edits made in the local app are **not** synced back to the cloud automatically — use Sync or drag the modified file back if you want it uploaded." = "在本機應用程式中所做的編輯**不會**自動同步回雲端——如果想上傳，請使用「同步」或將修改後的檔案拖回。";
"Quick Look" = "快速查看";
"Select a file and press **Space** to preview it without opening it." = "選擇一個檔案並按**空白鍵**即可在不打開的情況下預覽它。";
"File icons" = "檔案圖示";
"Local images and PDFs show a real preview thumbnail of the file content." = "本機影像和 PDF 會顯示檔案內容的真實預覽縮覽圖。";
"Cloud files show a colourful generic icon based on the file extension." = "雲端檔案會根據副檔名顯示彩色的通用圖示。";

